{"id":"00172","root":"uni00172_1","name":{"ja":"羽鳥　志津香","en":"Hatori Shizuka"},"title":null,"displayName":{"ja":"羽鳥　志津香","en":"Hatori Shizuka"},"element":"Spiritual","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","roles":[],"traits":["Taimanin"],"release":"2019-03-14","limited":false,"characterId":138,"profile":{"ja":"左目の邪眼を見た者の心の弱さを煽る邪眼【恐慌疑心】をもつ対魔忍。彼女の瞳に捉えられた者は強い恐怖や、猜疑心に支配され、精神の弱い者などは発狂することすらある。そんな敵の表情をじっくりと観察しながら仕留める為に、極小のプッシュダガーを手に敵を何度も切り刻む。恐怖に苛まれ、悲鳴を上げながら血まみれになる敵の姿はそれを見た者に敵味方問わず強い恐怖を与える。そしてその恐怖は伝聞で伝わり、さらに多くの者を恐怖させることで邪眼の効果をさらに高める。低級の魔族は邪眼の効果が無くとも震え上がり、新人の対魔忍すら彼女の姿を見掛けると緊張する。彼女自身もそんな新人を威圧し、さらに怖がらせるので指揮官にとっては扱いにくい対魔忍と言える。とはいえ、敵にギリギリまで接近した上で仕留めるその技量は一線級で、参考にする者も多い。性格はサディスティックかつ自信家で、常に自分が一番だと考えている。","en":"(Hatori Shizuka, she/her) A Taimanin wielding the cursed eye \"Panic Suspicion,\" which provokes the weakness in anyone who meets her left-eye glare. Those captured by her gaze are overwhelmed by intense fear and paranoia, and the mentally fragile may even go insane. To finish off such foes, she repeatedly slashes them with a tiny push dagger while closely observing their expressions. The sight of enemies trembling, screaming, and drenched in blood spreads terror to all who witness it, amplifying her eye's effect through rumor. Even low-rank demons shiver, and rookie Taimanin tense up at the mere sight of her. She herself intimidates and frightens those newcomers, making her a difficult asset for commanders. Nonetheless, her skill in closing to the enemy's brink and delivering the final blow is top-tier, earning many admirers. Her personality is sadistic and confident; she constantly believes she is the best."},"illustrator":"さのとしひで","voiceActor":"綾音まこ","forms":[{"id":"uni00172_1","rarity":2,"rarityLabel":"R","levelMax":50,"stats":{"hp":[716,1432],"sp":[160,160],"atk":[122,244],"def":[97,194],"spd":[47,47],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","130009"]},{"id":"uni00172_2","rarity":3,"rarityLabel":"HR","levelMax":60,"stats":{"hp":[1032,2064],"sp":[210,210],"atk":[194,388],"def":[144,288],"spd":[47,47],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","130009","130010"]},{"id":"uni00172_3","rarity":4,"rarityLabel":"SR","levelMax":80,"stats":{"hp":[1348,2694],"sp":[320,320],"atk":[266,536],"def":[191,381],"spd":[47,47],"luck":[1,80]},"spCharge":36,"skills":["3","130009","130010"]}],"skills":{"3":{"slot":"attack","id":3,"name":null,"hits":2,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":0,"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 100% Spiritual damage","tag":"instant"}]},"130009":{"slot":"skill1","id":130009,"name":{"ja":"自心自縛"},"hits":3,"cutin":false,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵３体に小威力で攻撃、高確率で麻痺状態にする"}},{"level":2,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵３体に小威力で攻撃、高確率で麻痺状態にする"}},{"level":3,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵３体に小威力で攻撃、高確率で麻痺状態にする"}},{"level":4,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵３体に小威力で攻撃、高確率で麻痺状態にする"}},{"level":5,"sp":160,"detail":{"ja":"敵３体に小威力で攻撃、高確率で麻痺状態にする"}}],"effects":[{"text":"3 enemies: 145% Spiritual damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"3 enemies: 50% chance to inflict Paralysis for 2 turns","icon":"paralysis","tag":"ailment","ref":"ab:2"}]},"130010":{"slot":"skill2","id":130010,"name":{"ja":"恐創裂傷"},"hits":6,"cutin":true,"levels":[{"level":1,"sp":210,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃、自身に中威力のダメージ"}},{"level":2,"sp":210,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃、自身に中威力のダメージ"}},{"level":3,"sp":210,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃、自身に中威力のダメージ"}},{"level":4,"sp":210,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃、自身に中威力のダメージ"}},{"level":5,"sp":210,"detail":{"ja":"敵１体に特大威力で攻撃、自身に中威力のダメージ"}}],"effects":[{"text":"1 enemy: 640% Spiritual damage","tag":"instant"},{"text":"Self: take 30% of max HP as damage","tag":"instant"}]}},"leader":{"name":{"ja":"邪眼【恐慌疑心】"},"detail":{"ja":"精神属性ユニットのSPDを小アップ"},"effects":[{"text":"Spiritual allies: SPD +10%","icon":"spd_up","tag":"passive"}]},"abilities":[],"bloom":{"po